# oracle: pair_style hybrid/overlay aip/water/2dm 16.0 lj/cut/coul/long 10 8.5 - the examples' graphene under water: the atoms of the example's 936-atom data with x in [27.4, 46) and y < 22.2 (171 C and 11 water molecules, 270 atoms, the example's box), 10 steps with SHAKE; compute pair c_1 (lj/cut/coul/long) and c_2 (aip/water/2dm: [attractive, repulsive]). The example's lj/cut/tip4p/long is replaced by lj/cut/coul/long: the browser engine refuses the TIP4P styles inside hybrid/overlay (virialFdotr is off for them)
# measured (engine vs native, black box; rel over |value| >= 1e-6; per-atom scale max(1,|value|)): thermo max abs 2.1e-8, max rel 6.8e-11; per-atom max scaled 3.5e-9. The residual is the PPPM Coulomb term: a run-0 variant with lj/cut and no kspace (the aip/water/2dm terms alone) measures thermo max abs 1.7e-13, per-atom 1.9e-12, and the run-0 case with the Coulomb term measures thermo abs 1.0e-9, per-atom 2.5e-10
# oracle-inputs: w102il_aip_water.data
# oracle-potentials: COH.DMC.aip.water.2dm
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           metal
boundary        p p p
atom_style      full
read_data       w102il_aip_water.data
mass            1 12.0107
mass            2 15.9994
mass            3 1.008
group           gr molecule 1
group           water molecule 2
pair_style      hybrid/overlay aip/water/2dm 16.0 lj/cut/coul/long 10 8.5
pair_coeff      1 1 none
pair_coeff      2 2 lj/cut/coul/long 8.0313e-3 3.1589
pair_coeff      2 3 lj/cut/coul/long 0.0 0.0
pair_coeff      3 3 lj/cut/coul/long 0.0 0.0
pair_coeff      * * aip/water/2dm COH.DMC.aip.water.2dm C Ow Hw
bond_style      harmonic
bond_coeff      1 0.0 0.9572
angle_style     harmonic
angle_coeff     1 0.0 104.52
kspace_style    pppm 1E-5
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 5 check yes page 1000000 one 100000
compute         1 all pair lj/cut/coul/long
compute         2 all pair aip/water/2dm
compute         wt water temp
thermo_style    custom step pe etotal ke c_1 c_2[1] c_2[2] c_wt
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          5
thermo_modify   lost error
fix             subf gr setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0
fix             1 water shake 0.0001 20 100 b 1 a 1
timestep        1e-3
velocity        water create 300.0 12345 dist gaussian mom yes rot yes
fix             2 water nve
run             0
run             10
